        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions Decorative Urn Tip  Acrylic Appliance Handle</b>\r\n<p>\r\nThe detailed filigree and urn tip end brackets of this truly unique decorative appliance handle will add incredible beauty to your refrigerator, freezer, compactor and dishwasher.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nMade in the USA by the master craftsmen at First Impressions from the finest  acrylic available. The acrylic is manufacture with UV inhibitors to prevent yellowing and fading. Available in your choice of <b>Frosted or Crystal Clear Acrylic</b>. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged with mounting screws for a refrigerator or other appliance door panel.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for First Impressions Urn Tip Acrylic Appliance Handle\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Material: Finest Acrylic</li>\r\n<li>Pull Bracket Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Pull Mounting: Standard 3/4\" Thick Appliance Panel</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Standard Lengths</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>FII-CF-MGRBURNA18: Total Length 18\" - Center to Center Mount: 13-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>FII-CF-MGRBURNA24: Total Length 24\" - Center to Center Mount: 19-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This urn tip acrylic appliance handle is handmade in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door application, including <b>Other Lengths</b> up to 4 feet. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the appliance handle, it is <b>Not Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged with mounting screws for a standard 3/4\" thick  refrigerator/appliance door panel.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>* Sold individually.</b>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Urn Tip Acrylic Appliance Handle, First Impressions CF-MGRBURNAx",
                "description": "First Impressions Decorative Acrylic Appliance Handle. Available lengths of 18 inches or 24 inches in your choice of Frosted or Clear Acrylic. The detailed filigree urn tip  end brackets of this truly unique decorative appliance door pull will add incredible beauty to your dishwasher and refrigerator  doors.",
